w cooperation. So C seems better.\n\nThus Sarah should align with Emily, vote for C, but maybe add nuance: note that C's egocentric and communication difficulty are concerns, but his positive crew atmosphere and reliability mitigate. Also note that A's lack of openness to criticism and unorganized could affect reliability. D's arrogance and weak leadership also problematic.\n\nThus Sarah's public message: agree with Emily, vote for C, explain why.\n\nMake sure to reference explicit facts: C's 100% reliability, positive crew atmosphere, quick correct decisions, calm in crisis, technical competence, but also difficulty communicating, egocentric, not willing to further education. Compare with B's grumpy/uncooperative, D's arrogance, A's unorganized and not good at criticism.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
